      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        164.44471740722656,
        527.4215698242188,
        181.6817169189453
      ],
      "text": "(122) In 2018, target groups for the provision of TPT were expanded to include contacts of all ages  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.6447296142578,
        527.4419555664062,
        194.88172912597656
      ],
      "text": "(78) Available data from the global TB database   show that coverage of TPT in household contacts is",
