      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        215.3426055908203,
        527.3479614257812,
        229.7855987548828
      ],
      "text": "In children with common illnesses with overlapping signs and symptoms of TB, approaches to integrate",
