      ],
      "text": "6.1.3. Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.2516174316406,
        527.3590698242188,
        380.8706359863281
      ],
      "text": "Health system requirements : Training of health care workers at peripheral levels of the health system",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.967401504516602,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.6275939941406,
        527.44189453125,
        394.07061767578125
      ],
      "text": "is a critical requirement to ensure adequate implementation of decentralized approaches. Similarly,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.8276062011719,
        527.4013671875,
        407.2706298828125
      ],
      "text": "resources are needed at the peripheral level, especially initially to establish services. It is expected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.0276184082031,
        527.3958129882812,
        420.47064208984375
      ],
      "text": "that as services are established and effectively implemented, the long-term impact will result in a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.22760009765625,
        527.44091796875,
        433.6706237792969
      ],
      "text": "decrease in TB incidence with an associated reduction in resource requirements. A phased approach",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.4276123046875,
        527.3739624023438,
        446.8706359863281
      ],
      "text": "may be applied if this is most appropriate in the country or area, depending on the local burden of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.6275939941406,
        482.2167053222656,
        460.07061767578125
      ],
      "text": "TB, availability of domestic or donor funding and of technical and programmatic support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.3315124511719,
        527.104736328125,
        481.7745361328125
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider in decentralizing child and adolescent TB services include: existing infrastructure (such",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.531494140625,
        527.5640258789062,
        494.9745178222656
      ],
      "text": "as baseline health infrastructure, needs for expansion or upgrading), applicable regulatory framework,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969708442687988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.73150634765625,
        527.3479614257812,
        508.1745300292969
      ],
      "text": "financing, choosing between an operational research setting or programmatic implementation, human",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953803062438965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.9315185546875,
        527.1433715820312,
        521.37451171875
      ],
      "text": "resource issues (including staffing requirements and human resources development, such as capacity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989344596862793,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.131591796875,
        527.416748046875,
        534.5745849609375
      ],
      "text": "building/training and consultation skills), monitoring and evaluation, conducting qualitative research",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.33154296875,
        527.41015625,
        547.7745361328125
      ],
      "text": "into community needs, perceptions (including views on stigma) and suggestions. Decentralization of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.531494140625,
        527.44091796875,
        560.9744873046875
      ],
      "text": "services to the PHC level requires child and adolescent TB services to be integrated within general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.7315063476562,
        527.4002685546875,
        574.1744995117188
      ],
      "text": "PHC services, resulting in possible significant overlap between decentralization and family-centred,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.931640625,
        179.868408203125,
        587.3746337890625
      ],
      "text": "integrated approaches.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.4595336914062,
        527.4378051757812,
        609.0784912109375
      ],
      "text": "Contact investigation : Active contact investigation at community and household level is a critical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.8355102539062,
        527.4323120117188,
        622.2785034179688
      ],
      "text": "intervention for enhancing both case finding and provision of TPT among children and adolescents.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.3634643554688,
        527.4240112304688,
        643.982421875
      ],
      "text": "Task shifting : Decentralization should not only concern the levels of the health system but should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.7393798828125,
        527.4058837890625,
        657.182373046875
      ],
      "text": "ideally also take place within the same structure, by training all health care providers of all child and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.9393920898438,
        527.4486694335938,
        670.3823852539062
      ],
      "text": "adolescent care services in the recognition and management of TB. This so-called task shifting was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.139404296875,
        361.8436279296875,
        683.5823974609375
      ],
      "text": "mentioned by the GDG as an important implementation factor.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.6674194335938,
        527.428955078125,
        705.286376953125
      ],
      "text": "Family-centred and integrated care : Although in child health, care evolves around the family, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        704.0433349609375,
        527.4309692382812,
        718.486328125
      ],
      "text": "concept of family-centred care has not been well defined. Family-centred care is related to the more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.4492797851562,
        527.4176025390625,
        731.686279296875
      ],
      "text": "(6) common concept of patient-centred care. In the End TB Strategy  : “Patient-centred care involves",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        730.4434204101562,
        527.4024658203125,
        744.8864135742188
      ],
      "text": "systematically assessing and addressing the needs and expectations of patients. The objective is to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.6434326171875,
        527.5753173828125,
        758.08642578125
      ],
      "text": "provide high-quality TB diagnosis and treatment to all patients – men, women and children – without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989945411682129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        756.8433837890625,
        527.4112548828125,
        771.286376953125
      ],
      "text": "their having to incur catastrophic costs. Depending on patients’ needs, educational, emotional and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
